1. Grant
   Subject to the terms of this license, anyone may obtain a copy of this
   software and its source code free of charge and is granted the right to:
   a) use, run and modify the software solely for personal study, research
      and non-commercial purposes;
   b) redistribute the software, original or modified, provided that you:
      i.  retain this license file in full;
      ii. credit the original author(s) and source (project name and
          repository URL) in a prominent place;
      iii.add no additional restrictions and take none of the rights the
          license grants to others.

2. Non-commercial restriction
   The software (including modified or derivative versions) or any part of
   it may NOT be used for commercial purposes, including but not limited to
   sale, rental, commercial distribution, paid services, revenue-bearing
   internal business use, or inclusion in a commercial product or service.
   "Commercial" means use primarily intended for commercial advantage or
   monetary compensation; personal everyday use and study do not count.

3. Unlicensed use
   Rights not expressly granted by this license are reserved by the author(s).
   Uses beyond its scope require prior written permission.

4. Disclaimer of warranty
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
   IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
   FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL
   THE AUTHORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING
   FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE.

5. Non-affiliation
   This is an unofficial project built for personal convenience. It is not
   affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic PBC or any Claude brand owner.
   Claude and related marks belong to their respective owners.

